{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_011_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ed5c4461eaa43a89df1c9548a8b0f72b36d99e7fff0a4e0ab55386f7fb5e4d54",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d41fdc60812fabafb8190b0754a2b579505c64e2a96144a02375f77fb814c0ba",
      "text": "闪耀的小小原石们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92c0e9e73145bbd4a9d26d6cfef49ef52d31e324a8f05e7af79e66aa5b24e5fd",
      "text": "出演少儿特别节目的孩子们。\n对于聚光灯只打在天才童星直央和\n模特花音身上感到不满的志狼，\n但却有人在他们身上看到了巨大可能性的萌芽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d41fdc60812fabafb8190b0754a2b579505c64e2a96144a02375f77fb814c0ba",
      "text": "闪耀的小小原石们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a039cf06af4506e409359278a1ece6eb2726a3af5efbce5b04b52c3993a68f6",
      "text": "“喂喂来信”环节，最后一封是……\n“请告诉大家你们擅长的科目”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5219486de4897e7026494bc37709b0187dfd41f0f996ea9d272ae75abadca02",
      "text": "我大概是语文吧。很喜欢读故事。\n花音君呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39364918479047d79e2fa992d9023e676904b9440fe23740db55d831364b8e84",
      "text": "嗯～花音大概是音乐吧。\n从小就一直在学钢琴哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0646ceedc14bd2105e7c604d542ca1dcae5dbb91977728104a648b88ed787c5",
      "text": "我是体育！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e82c3376f67f52cb0489dd5af121df45e20707b61b25f08546d4558d32b5fd0",
      "text": "前阵子打篮球，\n我还投进了灌篮呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d7bf2954fa59a433560529456c43ad8e7b76cea5fd679f46bef54e363e2b7b5",
      "text": "那么，和擅长音乐的花音君\n以及运动神经超群的志狼君一起进入下一个环节！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd0e1408e7652a9485de928944c50a687bbffd21cea3cdd9c9c24c3257e35b5f",
      "text": "“Let's 唱歌跳舞吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40d0462bbc7cbf0db0b4e113754e7fe1162dfe097a8bb251a5dc25dbbe5e5282",
      "text": "大家也学着我们的样子一起试一试吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:858560f8832647d81f65a600ded95dd0a3f15b268ce20336b8a32447c2a781a7",
      "text": "和花音一起，可爱地唱歌吧～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7c2f46c10ccbdfe9055ccb63b0ccf80ec3f822953561fadd73a515108b1a199",
      "text": "别忘了跳舞哦！\n合着歌曲，好好把身体动起来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_01_1_1_011_01:1_1_011_01_a:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:158a8ff1f2810b1abfb732681caab969be334f62ff38bcfe75f08de7e597ef2c",
      "text": "那么，要开始咯～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
